    "src/app/legal/terms-of-service/page.message26EngageInAnyCryptocurrencyMining":
      '(26) Engage in any cryptocurrency mining, including but not limited to Bitcoin mining, Ethereum mining, or any other form of digital currency mining. For the purposes of this agreement, "cryptocurrency mining" refers to the process of using computer processing power to validate and record transactions in a public ledger for a cryptocurrency network. This includes any operation that involves the use of Company or Provider resources to solve complex mathematical problems or algorithms associated with the generation or transaction of cryptocurrencies.',
